{"4426390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Evidentia", "steam_appid": 4426390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/1ebb81224477503235f5f7b5faf00a74.avif?t=1787862995\" width=414 height=198 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A cooperative detective card game for a group of friends</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/a36806d0aac179c086c1ab7cccfa8b49.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/a36806d0aac179c086c1ab7cccfa8b49.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/a36806d0aac179c086c1ab7cccfa8b49.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/30a71c3938dc02eb0b026abb51f0d6ce.avif?t=1787862995\" width=570 height=208 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evidentia is a cooperative detective card game where each deck of cards is a separate, unique story. Murder, disappearance, theft, conspiracy, or an absurd event — every case unfolds in its own time and setting: from the dawn of civilization and the Middle Ages to the present day or the distant future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players join a shared lobby with an access code and investigate together. The built-in chat helps coordinate actions, while voice communication is handled separately — for example, via Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about attention to detail, trusting your team, knowing when to doubt, and not jumping to conclusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New case decks are added over time — each one a self-contained story with its own setting, suspects, and secrets. More mysteries are on the way, so there's always a fresh case for your team to crack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/716c7080541a2ece90865134ccebadcd.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/716c7080541a2ece90865134ccebadcd.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/716c7080541a2ece90865134ccebadcd.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/79cc1516bd7b39008128c637409efde1.avif?t=1787862995\" width=403 height=225 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a member of a detective team trying to make sense of a strange and tangled situation. Throughout the game you'll receive clues, evidence, and fragments of information. Some of them will bring you closer to the truth — others may be false leads that send the team down a dead end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single leader here. Every decision is the result of collective thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/2d9fb2e3d9c35cdc56c2d2b6b15a022e.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/2d9fb2e3d9c35cdc56c2d2b6b15a022e.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/2d9fb2e3d9c35cdc56c2d2b6b15a022e.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/358c0dc35d3145eb4d55fb90f92d8e5a.avif?t=1787862995\" width=530 height=241 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evidence Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the game each player receives 3 random cards. The first card from the deck immediately appears on the table for all players and sets the direction of the investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/dcde09d043df49d459ed61264fcb8433.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/dcde09d043df49d459ed61264fcb8433.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/dcde09d043df49d459ed61264fcb8433.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>False Clues and Risk</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every card is useful. If a card seems odd or irrelevant to you — feel free to discard it. But be careful: wrong decisions hurt your final score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Clues and the Die</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards contain hidden parts of an image or text. To reveal them, you need to roll the die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the die — but remember, the risk is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/9aa03e76a7f1b2159ce557aa7aa929bc.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/9aa03e76a7f1b2159ce557aa7aa929bc.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/9aa03e76a7f1b2159ce557aa7aa929bc.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange and unexpected events can occur during the investigation. They may cause players to lose cards — or grant additional clues. There's no full control, and that's exactly what makes each session unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Discard Pile</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If fewer than the required number of cards are discarded by the end of the game — the game ends early in defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work through the riddles and puzzles woven into the cards — tackle them together with your team, or take the investigation solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/92bca836ab38cb2e1ba064f9f8edc924.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/92bca836ab38cb2e1ba064f9f8edc924.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/92bca836ab38cb2e1ba064f9f8edc924.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Stage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all cards have been played or discarded, the final discussion begins. At this stage players are allowed to talk through the discarded cards and piece together a complete picture of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, players open the envelope with questions. Each person answers as they see fit — even if the team disagrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/b1cf8b12b168b388f70b5ff7c93a0a2a.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/b1cf8b12b168b388f70b5ff7c93a0a2a.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/b1cf8b12b168b388f70b5ff7c93a0a2a.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each case is unique and can only be played once. Once you know the solution, the experience is gone. That's why Evidentia encourages players to try new decks and share the experience with other groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/cb865a2692688f4a0f7a48d807dd9369.avif?t=1787862995\" width=692 height=201 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For groups of friends, remote hangouts and game nights, and team-building with a focus on communication and collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best experience comes from playing with friends in real time, with voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some decks may contain depictions of violence or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evidentia is more than just a game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's a shared investigation where the truth is born from arguments, mistakes, and sudden breakthroughs.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you trust your team… and will you find the right answer?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/1ebb81224477503235f5f7b5faf00a74.avif?t=1787862995\" width=414 height=198 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A cooperative detective card game for a group of friends</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/a36806d0aac179c086c1ab7cccfa8b49.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/a36806d0aac179c086c1ab7cccfa8b49.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/a36806d0aac179c086c1ab7cccfa8b49.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/30a71c3938dc02eb0b026abb51f0d6ce.avif?