.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/dcde09d043df49d459ed61264fcb8433.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>False Clues and Risk</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every card is useful. If a card seems odd or irrelevant to you — feel free to discard it. But be careful: wrong decisions hurt your final score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Clues and the Die</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards contain hidden parts of an image or text. To reveal them, you need to roll the die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the die — but remember, the risk is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/9aa03e76a7f1b2159ce557aa7aa929bc.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/9aa03e76a7f1b2159ce557aa7aa929bc.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/9aa03e76a7f1b2159ce557aa7aa929bc.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange and unexpected events can occur during the investigation. They may cause players to lose cards — or grant additional clues. There's no full control, and that's exactly what makes each session unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Discard Pile</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If fewer than the required number of cards are discarded by the end of the game — the game ends early in defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work through the riddles and puzzles woven into the cards — tackle them together with your team, or take the investigation solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/92bca836ab38cb2e1ba064f9f8edc924.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/92bca836ab38cb2e1ba064f9f8edc924.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/92bca836ab38cb2e1ba064f9f8edc924.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Stage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all cards have been played or discarded, the final discussion begins. At this stage players are allowed to talk through the discarded cards and piece together a complete picture of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, players open the envelope with questions. Each person answers as they see fit — even if the team disagrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/b1cf8b12b168b388f70b5ff7c93a0a2a.poster.avif?t=1787862995\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/b1cf8b12b168b388f70b5ff7c93a0a2a.webm?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/b1cf8b12b168b388f70b5ff7c93a0a2a.mp4?t=1787862995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each case is unique and can only be played once. Once you know the solution, the experience is gone. That's why Evidentia encourages players to try new decks and share the experience with other groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/extras/cb865a2692688f4a0f7a48d807dd9369.avif?t=1787862995\" width=692 height=201 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For groups of friends, remote hangouts and game nights, and team-building with a focus on communication and collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best experience comes from playing with friends in real time, with voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some decks may contain depictions of violence or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evidentia is more than just a game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's a shared investigation where the truth is born from arguments, mistakes, and sudden breakthroughs.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you trust your team… and will you find the right answer?</i></p>", "short_description": "Evidentia is a cooperative detective card game for friends. Each deck is a unique case. Analyze evidence, take risks, question everything — and find out if you can solve it before the final reveal.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Ukrainian, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426390/3e34bf83c71cf7749adf051e24db1bf7241d474c/header.jpg?t=1787862995", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it